    "本应用不内置、不提供、也不使用任何相机品牌素材。所有图标均由用户从“文件”App 本地导入，不会上传。请确保你有权使用所选素材。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This application does not build in, provide, or use any camera brand materials. All icons are imported locally by the user from the Files App and will not be uploaded. Please make sure you have permission to use the selected material."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本應用程式不內建、不提供、也不使用任何相機品牌素材。所有圖示均由使用者從「檔案」App 本機匯入，不會上傳。請確保你有權使用所選素材。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
