          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本次将灵动卡片、气泡印章与琉璃档案的功能设定，从设置页直接放进了对应的功能里，随用随达，让创作更顺手。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This update moves the settings for Motion Card, Bubble Stamp and Glass Archive out of the Settings page and directly into their respective features, ready whenever you need them, making creation smoother."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本次將靈動卡片、氣泡印章與琉璃檔案的功能設定，從設置頁直接放進了對應的功能裡，隨用隨達，讓創作更順手。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本次更新" : {
