      }
    },
    "本次添加了寻找本机原图，扫描票根后可在本机相册里找回当初封存的那张原片，随时重温拍摄那一刻。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This update adds Find Original on This Device: after scanning a ticket, find the original photo you sealed back then in your on-device photo library, and relive that moment anytime."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本次添加了尋找本機原圖，掃描票根後可在本機相簿裡找回當初封存的那張原片，隨時重溫拍攝那一刻。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本次添加了琉璃档案，以液态玻璃档案栏封存设备、参数与坐标的原始记录，让每张照片都有据可查。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This update adds Glass Archive: a liquid-glass archive bar sealing the original records of device, parameters and coordinates, so every photo can be traced."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本次添加了琉璃檔案，以液態玻璃檔案欄封存設備、參數與座標的原始記錄，讓每張照片都有據可查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本次添加了票根显影，导入实体票的照片即可智能识别，让旧票根重制成可验证的影像票根。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This update adds Ticket Developing: import photos of physical tickets for smart recognition, rebirthing old stubs into verifiable photo stubs."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本次添加了票根顯影，導入實體票的照片即可智能識別，讓舊票根重製成可驗證的影像票根。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本次添加了票根集，把旅行、演出或某一段时光的影像票根整理分集，收纳成属于你的票夹。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
