    },
    "颜色提取、关系文案与作品渲染均在设备本机完成。Live Photo 在此功能中只读取系统提供的静态照片。液态玻璃色带中，每组左侧颜色来自图 1，右侧颜色来自图 2。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Color extraction, relationship copywriting and work rendering are all completed locally on the device. Live Photo only reads system-provided still photos in this function. In the liquid glass ribbon, the colors on the left of each set are from Figure 1 and the colors on the right are from Figure 2."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "顏色擷取、關係文案與作品渲染皆在設備本機完成。 Live Photo 在此功能中只讀取系統提供的靜態照片。液態玻璃色帶中，每組左側顏色來自圖 1，右側顏色來自圖 2。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
